    {
      "id": "python-stdlib-data-logging-c01",
      "type": "code",
      "prompt": "输入一个非负整数重试次数 n（0 到 100，含端点）。配置 logging 将 WARNING 及以上消息写到标准输出，格式仅包含消息。输出一条 WARNING：retry planned: n，其中冒号后一个空格；不输出时间、级别前缀或原始输入。无效整数、空输入或越界时不输出内容，退出码 1。起始代码已验证 n；本题不执行实际重试。",
      "starter_code": "import sys\ntext = sys.stdin.read().strip()\nimport logging\ntry:\n    n = int(text)\nexcept ValueError:\n    raise SystemExit(1)\nif not 0 <= n <= 100:\n    raise SystemExit(1)\n# 完成本课操作与输出\n",
      "visible_tests": [
        "输入 '1'，输出 'retry planned: 1\\n'，退出码 0。",
        "输入 '3'，输出 'retry planned: 3\\n'，退出码 0。"
      ],
      "experience_points": 15,
      "private": {
        "reference_solution": "import sys\ntext = sys.stdin.read().strip()\nimport logging\ntry:\n    n = int(text)\nexcept ValueError:\n    raise SystemExit(1)\nif not 0 <= n <= 100:\n    raise SystemExit(1)\nlogging.basicConfig(level=logging.WARNING, format=\"%(message)s\", stream=sys.stdout)\nlogging.warning(\"retry planned: %s\", n)\n",
        "hidden_tests": [
          "核对题面声明的正常边界。",
          "输入、输出和退出状态必须符合题面。"
        ],
        "visible_test_cases": [
          {
            "stdin": "1",
            "stdout": "retry planned: 1\n",
            "exit_code": 0
          },
          {
            "stdin": "3",
            "stdout": "retry planned: 3\n",
            "exit_code": 0
          }
        ],
        "hidden_test_cases": [
          {
            "stdin": "0",
            "stdout": "retry planned: 0\n",
            "exit_code": 0
          },
          {
            "stdin": "100",
            "stdout": "retry planned: 100\n",
            "exit_code": 0
          },
          {
